# GitLab Issues Context

## Voice
- Write issue titles as imperative: "Fix X", "Add Y", "Remove Z"
- Bug reports: describe observed behavior, expected behavior, reproduction steps
- Feature requests: describe the user problem first, then the proposed solution

## Vocabulary
- MR — merge request (not PR)
- ~backend, ~frontend, ~infra — common label slugs
- /draft — GitLab quick action to mark an MR as draft
- /assign @username — GitLab quick action to assign

## Templates
- Bug: Title / Steps to reproduce / Expected / Actual / Environment
- Feature: Problem / Proposed solution / Acceptance criteria
